      "text": "🚦 TRAFFIC ADVISORY – JPMC RUN 2026\n\nA running event will be conducted in the IT corridor area of Cyberabad, covering roads around Sattva Knowledge City and nearby tech zones.\n\n Date: Sunday, 1 March 2026\n⏰ Time: 06:30 AM to 08:00 AM\n🏃 Distances: 5K & 10K Runs\n👥 Participants: Approx. 1200\n\n📍 Route Coverage:\nGate No.5 – Sattva Knowledge City → RMZ Junction → Qualcomm Dead End → Thangedu Restaurant → Dallas Center Road → T-Hub → C-Gate → Gate No.8 → Return to Gate No.5\n\n⚠ Advisory for Commuters:\n• Expect temporary road diversions in the event zone\n• Plan alternate routes in advance\n• Follow volunteers and event signage\n• Drive slowly and remain alert\n• Prioritize safety for all road users\n\nYour cooperation ensures smooth traffic movement and a safe event for all.\n\nRoads Shared. Safety First. \n\n#JPMCRun2026 #TrafficAdvisory #CyberabadTraffic #HyderabadTraffic #KnowledgeCity #DriveSafe #PlanAlternateRoute #TrafficUpdate #RoadSafety #ArriveAlive #FollowTrafficRules #PublicSafety #StayAlert #SafeCommute #EventTraffic",
